{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato","soma"],"title":"Dhīrā","html":"<article id='thig1.6'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Therīgāthā 1.6 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Nuns 1.6 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>Verses of the Elder Bhikkhunīs </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>Chapter of the Ones </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Dhīrātherīgāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Dhīrā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>Verses of the Elder Dhīrā </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Dhīre nirodhaṁ phusehi, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Dhīrā, touch cessation, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>“Dhīrā, touch cessation, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Saññāvūpasamaṁ sukhaṁ; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>the blissful settling of perception. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>the joyful pacification of perception. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Ārādhayāhi nibbānaṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Win extinguishment, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>Attain Nirvana, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Yogakkhemamanuttaran”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>the supreme sanctuary from the yoke. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>the utmost safety from bondage.” </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Dhīrā therī …. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>The Elder Dhīrā </span></p></article>"}
